This license covers the game's code and original data files. Art, audio, and
other media assets in this repository are covered by their own licenses — see
wandering_inn_game_v4/assets/LICENSES/ and ATTRIBUTION.md. Some assets used
in official builds are not redistributable and are NOT included in this
repository; the game builds and runs fully with the included fallback art.

The Wandering Inn is a web serial by pirateaba (wanderinginn.com). This is an
unofficial fan project; setting, characters, and lore belong to pirateaba.
